504 likes, 47 comments - lonelyplanet on October 21, 2026: ""Costa Brava is our happy place," says Lonely Planet Correspondent Carla of @eatinbcn, who spent most of her summer in the Catalonian rugged coast just under two hours' drive from her home in Barcelona. She recommends exploring the villages of Peratallada, Monells, Ullastret and Begur and visiting in late fall when it's quieter – her top spots 👇
